@gateway = http://localhost:8888

### Eureka registry
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Configuration shared by Config Server
GET http://localhost:9999/transaction-service/default

### Accounts through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/accounts

> {% client.global.set("accountId", response.body.find(account => account.status === "ACTIVE").id); %}

### Transactions through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/transactions

### Create transaction through Gateway (Feign resolves account-service through Eureka)
POST {{gateway}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": 25.50, "currency": "MAD",
  "merchantCategory": "GROCERY", "country": "MA"
}

### GraphQL - accounts
POST {{gateway}}/account-service/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "{ getAllAccounts { id customerReference currency balance } }" }

### GraphQL - transactions
POST {{gateway}}/transaction-service/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "{ getAllTransactions { id accountId amount processingStatus createdAt } }" }

### Gateway readiness
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health/readiness